{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_01",
      "hash": "c0acad6e104def2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「啊啊～"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_02",
      "hash": "c0acb06e104df445",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我在這裡畫大海的素描，\\n畫得太專心了。\\c\\n都沒發現船開走了呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub061_select_01",
      "hash": "ba9e74d1ec76efcd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真糟糕！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub061_select_02",
      "hash": "ba9e71d1ec76eab4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_03",
      "hash": "c0acaf6e104df292",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯……\\c\\n茉莉就暫時留在這裡好了。\\c\\n茉莉喜歡上關都大海的顏色啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_04",
      "hash": "c0acaa6e104dea13",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "茉莉「關都的訓練家！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要和茉莉的\\n妖精屬性寶可夢對戰看看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_05",
      "hash": "c0aca96e104de860",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就跟茉莉一起看海吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_06",
      "hash": "c0acac6e104ded79",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呵呵呵……\\c\\n那就來吧！\\n真想趕快讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳知道\\r\\n妖精屬性的優點！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_07",
      "hash": "c0acab6e104debc6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦哦！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳和[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢真棒！\\c\\n多麼棒的主題！\\n真想畫下來。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub061_fairy_08",
      "hash": "c0acb66e104dfe77",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "茉莉「在打敗[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳之前，\\n茉莉是不能回阿羅拉的。\\c\\n說笑的啦。\\c\\n不過，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳下次也要\\n和茉莉對戰喔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_061_max",
      "hash": "f1956e3fcb7adec7"
    }
  ]
}
